---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Khurafaati Sameer" description="Privacy Policy for Khurafaati Sameer.">
  <main class="legal"><p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="updated">Last updated: August 19, 2026</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>If you contact us or subscribe to our newsletter, we may receive information you choose to provide, such as your name and email address.</p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2><p>We use submitted information to respond to enquiries, provide requested updates, operate the website, prevent abuse, and improve our content and services.</p>
  <h2>Newsletter</h2><p>If you subscribe, your email is used to send the updates you requested. You can unsubscribe through the available subscription mechanism or by contacting us.</p>
  <h2>Contact submissions</h2><p>Contact messages are processed through the website's form provider and may be retained for responding to your enquiry and legitimate administrative purposes.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>The site may use essential technologies and, if analytics are enabled in the future, analytics technologies to understand website usage. Any third-party service will process data according to its own policies.</p>
  <h2>Third-party links</h2><p>Our website may link to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices or content.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may contact us to ask about information you submitted through our forms or to request that it be corrected or removed, subject to legal and operational requirements.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, use our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></main>
  <style>.legal{max-width:820px;margin:auto;padding:65px 20px 90px}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,58px);margin:5px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-2px}.updated{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:38px}.legal h2{font-size:22px;margin:30px 0 9px}.legal p{color:#444;line-height:1.8}.legal a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}</style>
</Layout>
